# Backups the GDMacros App writes next to a file when it saves over it.
*.json.bak

# Supabase CLI scratch state. Machine-local, and it carries the project ref,
# organisation id and pooler host, none of which belong in a public repo.
supabase/.temp/

# Screenshots written by the verification scripts. Evidence for a test run, not
# part of the site.
shots/
.test-build/

# Agent instruction files that `next dev` generates at the repository root on
# every run (Next 16 does this unless `agentRules: false` is set). They are
# machine-generated local scratch, have never been tracked here, and are
# regenerated on demand, so ignoring them is preferable to editing unrelated
# Next configuration. Without this a `git add -A` sweeps them into what is a
# PUBLIC repository, which is the same near-miss `supabase/.temp/` caused.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

# Runtime state for the MediaFire to GitHub Releases migration: per-file
# progress, hashes and the resulting URL mapping. Machine-local and resumable,
# regenerated by the tool, and not something to review in a diff.
.migration/
